        "programText": "",
        "options": {
          "type": "Text",
          "markdown": "# Ops\n\nQueues that need a human: mail flagged for attention, orders to ship, new job matches, calendar errors. Freshness for these feeds is on Overview and Bot Ops.\n\n[Overview](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OVERVIEW_MISSION_CONTROL>) \u00b7 [Bot Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BOT_OPS>) \u00b7 [Trading](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_TRADING>) \u00b7 [Golf](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_GOLF>) \u00b7 [Birds](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BIRDS>) \u00b7 [Home](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_HOME>) \u00b7 **Ops**\n\nColors: green = fine, gold = watch (75% of budget used), red = act now. Tile titles say what to do."
        },
        "description": null,
